{\listtext\f1 1.\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1\b\fs36 Backup and Recovery:\b0\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f1\u10625?\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\ilvl1\widctlpar\fi-360\li1440\sa160\sl252\slmult1\b Regular Backups\b0 : \fs32 Periodically backing up configurations, critical data, and network settings ensures quick recovery in case of hardware failure, data corruption, or cyberattacks.\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f1 2.\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1\b\fs36 Monitoring and Performance Tuning:\b0\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f1\u10625?\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\ilvl1\widctlpar\fi-360\li1440\sa160\sl252\slmult1\b Network Monitoring\b0 : \fs32 Continuously monitoring network traffic, device health, and performance metrics (like bandwidth utilization) helps detect issues such as congestion, latency, or security incidents.\par

