{\listtext\f1\u10625?\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\ilvl1\widctlpar\fi-360\li1440\sa160\sl252\slmult1\b Documenting Changes and Configurations\b0 : \fs28 Keeping an updated record of network configurations, device settings, IP addressing, and layout helps in troubleshooting and network upgrades\fs32 .\par

