{\listtext\f1 5.\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1\b\fs36 Testing and Troubleshooting:\b0\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f1\u10625?\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\ilvl1\widctlpar\fi-360\li1440\sa160\sl252\slmult1\b Routine Testing\b0 : \fs32 Performing regular tests like pinging devices, running traceroutes, and checking for network performance issues ensures that all systems are functioning correctly.\par
{\listtext\f1 1\tab}\b\fs36 Troubleshooting and Issue Resolution\b0 : \fs32 Quickly diagnosing and resolving network issues (such as device failures, misconfigurations, or connection problems) helps maintain optimal operation.\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f1 6.\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1\b\fs36 Network Configuration Management:\b0\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f1\u10625?\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\ilvl1\widctlpar\fi-360\li1440\sa160\sl252\slmult1\b Configuration Backups\b0 : \fs32 Storing and regularly updating configuration files from network devices (routers, switches, firewalls) ensures quick recovery and consistency.\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f1 7.\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1\b\fs36 Network Scalability Planning:\b0\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f1\u10625?\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\ilvl1\widctlpar\fi-360\li1440\sa160\sl252\slmult1\b Capacity Planning\b0 : \fs32 Analyzing the current network load and planning for future growth helps ensure that the network infrastructure can handle increasing demand.\par
{\listtext\f1 1\tab}\b\fs36 Hardware Upgrades\b0 : \fs32 Proactively upgrading hardware components ensures the network can scale efficiently as the organization grows.\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f1 8.\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\widctlpar\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl252\slmult1\b\fs36 User Support and Training:\b0\par

\pard 
{\listtext\f1\u10625?\tab}\jclisttab\tx360\ls1\ilvl1\widctlpar\fi-360\li1440\sa160\sl252\slmult1\b User Education\b0 : \fs32 Regularly training employees on security best practices (e.g., avoiding phishing, password management) helps minimize the risk of human error or security breaches.\par
{\listtext\f1 1\tab}\b\fs36 Support for End Users\b0\fs32 : Providing regular technical support for users helps in resolving connectivity issues, misconfigurations, and other network-related problems quickly.\par

